    "accessibility": {
      "short": "Painting of two large haystacks in a colorful, textured field with distant trees and hills under a soft sky.",
      "long": "A horizontally oriented painting showing two rounded haystacks—one larger on the right, one smaller on the left—set in an open field. The field surface is rendered with visible, multicolored brushstrokes of pink, green, blue, and yellow, evoking light on uneven terrain. Behind the haystacks lies a band of dark green and purple foliage, with faint white structures barely visible among the trees. Rolling hills form the far background beneath a pale, luminous sky that transitions from warm tones at the horizon to cooler tones above. The entire surface shows thick, impasto-like texture, especially around the haystacks.",
